s from the states of Chu, Zhao, Wei, Han, Yan, and Qi have crossed into Qin territory. Realizing too late the purpose behind Li Mu's truce with Qin, Zheng quickly gathers his advisors to devise a plan to address the six-state coalition army on their doorstep. For the first time in history, the state of Qin faces complete destruction and must use every resource and strategy at their disposal to prevent themselves from being wiped off the map.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"War","rank":99,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":98,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Military","rank":98,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Politics","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Foreign","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ancient China","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Royal Affairs","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Kingdom Season 3","english":"Kingdom Season 3","native":"キングダム 第3シリーズ","romaji":"Kingdom 3rd Season","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"王者天下 第三季"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Kingdom (2020)"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"キングダム (2020)"}]},"trailer":{"id":"DhqXahrUTC4","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/DhqXahrUTC4/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}